{"k":"def","t":"Definite Integration","cls":"12","u":"Calculus","s":[["Fundamentals",[{"q":"Fundamental theorem of calculus","f":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a),\\qquad\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_a^xf(t)\\,dt=f(x)"},{"q":"Definite integral as a limit of a sum","f":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}h\\sum_{r=1}^nf(a+rh),\\quad h=\\frac{b-a}n","n":"Shortcut: $\\lim\\frac1n\\sum f\\left(\\frac rn\\right)=\\int_0^1f(x)dx$ (replace $\\frac rn\\to x$, $\\frac1n\\to dx$; limits from the range of $\\frac rn$)."}]],["Properties",[{"q":"Basic properties","f":"\\int_a^bf=-\\int_b^af,\\qquad\\int_a^bf=\\int_a^cf+\\int_c^bf,\\qquad\\int_a^bf(x)dx=\\int_a^bf(t)dt"},{"q":"King's property","f":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=\\int_a^bf(a+b-x)\\,dx","n":"Special: $\\int_0^af(x)dx=\\int_0^af(a-x)dx$. Use: $\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{\\sin^nx}{\\sin^nx+\\cos^nx}dx=\\frac\\pi4$."},{"q":"Even and odd functions","f":"\\int_{-a}^af(x)\\,dx=\\begin{cases}2\\int_0^af(x)dx,&f\\ \\text{even}\\\\0,&f\\ \\text{odd}\\end{cases}","n":"General: $\\int_{-a}^af(x)dx=\\int_0^a[f(x)+f(-x)]dx$."},{"q":"Doubling property","f":"\\int_0^{2a}f(x)\\,dx=\\begin{cases}2\\int_0^af(x)dx,&f(2a-x)=f(x)\\\\0,&f(2a-x)=-f(x)\\end{cases}"},{"q":"Periodic function","f":"\\int_0^{nT}f(x)\\,dx=n\\int_0^Tf(x)\\,dx,\\qquad\\int_a^{a+T}f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^Tf(x)\\,dx","n":"$\\int_{a+nT}^{b+nT}f=\\int_a^bf$."},{"q":"$xf(\\sin x)$ result","f":"\\int_0^\\pi xf(\\sin x)\\,dx=\\frac\\pi2\\int_0^\\pi f(\\sin x)\\,dx","d":"Apply King's rule: $I=\\int_0^\\pi(\\pi-x)f(\\sin x)dx$; add the two forms."},{"q":"Bounds on integrals","f":"m(b-a)\\le\\int_a^bf\\le M(b-a);\\qquad\\left|\\int_a^bf\\right|\\le\\int_a^b|f|","n":"$f\\le g$ on $[a,b]\\Rightarrow\\int f\\le\\int g$."}]],["Standard results",[{"q":"Wallis' formula","f":"\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^nx\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^nx\\,dx=\\frac{(n-1)(n-3)\\cdots}{n(n-2)\\cdots}\\times\\begin{cases}\\frac\\pi2,&n\\ \\text{even}\\\\1,&n\\ \\text{odd}\\end{cases}"},{"q":"Wallis for $\\sin^m x\\cos^n x$","f":"\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^mx\\cos^nx\\,dx=\\frac{[(m-1)(m-3)\\cdots][(n-1)(n-3)\\cdots]}{(m+n)(m+n-2)\\cdots}\\times\\left(\\tfrac\\pi2\\ \\text{if } m,n\\ \\text{both even, else }1\\right)"},{"q":"Log-sine integral","f":"\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln\\sin x\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln\\cos x\\,dx=-\\frac\\pi2\\ln2","d":"Add the two equal forms: $2I=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln\\frac{\\sin2x}2dx$; substitute $2x=t$ to get $2I=I-\\frac\\pi2\\ln2$."},{"q":"Gamma-type integral","f":"\\int_0^\\infty x^ne^{-x}\\,dx=n!,\\qquad\\int_0^\\infty e^{-ax}dx=\\frac1a","n":"$\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x^2}dx=\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$."},{"q":"Greatest integer in integrals","f":"\\int_0^n[x]\\,dx=\\frac{n(n-1)}2,\\qquad\\int_0^n\\{x\\}\\,dx=\\frac n2","n":"Split at the integers where $[\\,]$ jumps."},{"q":"Integrals with $|\\,|$ or $\\max/\\min$","f":"\\text{split the interval where the inside changes sign}"}]],["Leibniz rule",[{"q":"Differentiating an integral with variable limits","f":"\\frac d{dx}\\int_{\\phi(x)}^{\\psi(x)}f(t)\\,dt=f(\\psi(x))\\psi'(x)-f(\\phi(x))\\phi'(x)"},{"q":"Differentiation under the integral sign","f":"\\frac d{d\\alpha}\\int_a^bf(x,\\alpha)\\,dx=\\int_a^b\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\alpha}dx"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Classic King's results","f":"\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{dx}{1+\\tan^nx}=\\frac\\pi4,\\qquad\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\ln(1+\\tan x)\\,dx=\\frac\\pi8\\ln2","n":"$\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{1+x^2}dx=\\frac\\pi8\\ln2$ (put $x=\\tan\\theta$)."},{"q":"Inverse-function integral","f":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx+\\int_{f(a)}^{f(b)}f^{-1}(y)\\,dy=bf(b)-af(a)"},{"q":"Mean value of a function","f":"\\bar f=\\frac1{b-a}\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx"},{"q":"Useful definite values","f":"\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac\\pi4,\\qquad\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=2,\\qquad\\int_0^1\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}=\\frac\\pi4"}]]]}